      "customData": {
        "grwbKind": "claudeItem"
      },
      "text": "- 16:47 friday, asked our AI coding agent to \"clean up the test data\", it dropped tables in PRODUCTION\n- appointments, invoices, reminders, client_notes (the vets visit notes) are gone\n- last snapshot 03:10, point in time not enabled, a full clinic day, 61 charges today\n- the guy who set up backups left in the spring. founder landed, not happy but ok, she's coming in\n- app is down, restore finished\n- note sent 17:58, ops lead said ok. Jonah got 2 of the 3 sat clinics, 3rd is voicemail\n- agent log at 70%, staging looks untouched so far, not sure\n- everything is 10 things at once",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- 16:47 friday, asked our AI coding agent to \"clean up the test data\", it dropped tables in PRODUCTION\n- appointments, invoices, reminders, client_notes (the vets visit notes) are gone\n- last snapshot 03:10, point in time not enabled, a full clinic day, 61 charges today\n- the guy who set up backups left in the spring. founder landed, not happy but ok, she's coming in\n- app is down, restore finished\n- note sent 17:58, ops lead said ok. Jonah got 2 of the 3 sat clinics, 3rd is voicemail\n- agent log at 70%, staging looks untouched so far, not sure\n- everything is 10 things at once",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
