      "customData": {
        "grwbKind": "claudeItem"
      },
      "text": "real bookings:\n- every booking sends a confirmation email, Jonah says about 140 today in the email log\n- phone bookings the clinic typed in also send one I think\n- so the email log is the list, not sure its complete\n- first one opens at 8\n\nnot break anything else:\n- the 4 tables have to be there with sane row counts\n- the survivors have todays rows but the restored ones stop at 3am, so stuff will point at nothing\n- someone has to look at that\n- no idea how long switching takes, never done it",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "real bookings:\n- every booking sends a confirmation email, Jonah says about 140 today in the email log\n- phone bookings the clinic typed in also send one I think\n- so the email log is the list, not sure its complete\n- first one opens at 8\n\nnot break anything else:\n- the 4 tables have to be there with sane row counts\n- the survivors have todays rows but the restored ones stop at 3am, so stuff will point at nothing\n- someone has to look at that\n- no idea how long switching takes, never done it",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "YZXs6cg1mIE60q7dRAHgq",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 814,
      "y": 3810,
      "width": 378.97979736328125,
      "height": 350,
