      "text": "a) every booking sends a confirmation email, Jonah says about 140 today in the email log. phone bookings the clinic typed in also send one I think. so the email log is the list, not sure its complete\nb) the 4 tables have to be there with sane row counts. the survivors have todays rows but the restored ones stop at 3am so stuff will point at nothing. someone has to look at that. and no idea how long switching takes, never done it",
