        "grwbKind": "claudeItem"
      },
      "text": "- rebuild those 3 clinics sat bookings from the email log\n    - Jonah pulls the 3 clinics out of the email log into a sheet, checks them with each clinic\n        - 23:00 Jonah: 3 clinic sheet done, sends to founder, goes home\n- find and fix the records that point at nothing\n    - read the surviving tables out of prod, only reading, and load them into the restored copy\n      or a second copy of it so I can redo it if I mess up\n        - 21:45 me: manual snapshot, 2nd copy from it\n    - I list every record pointing at nothing, on the copy, decide keep or blank with founder when she lands\n        - 00:30 me + founder: put survivors + copy together, list broken records, she decides keep or blank\n- practice the switch on the copy so we dont do it for the 1st time at 7am\n    - run the switch once on the copy tonight, time it, write the steps down\n        - 01:30 me: practice switch, time it, write steps. founder reads them out\n        - 06:15 go/no go on switch\n- 7am\n    - send those 3 clinics their sat list by email no matter what, so paper is the backup\n        - 7:00 Jonah: sat lists to 3 clinics either way\n- 02:00-06:00 sleep",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- rebuild those 3 clinics sat bookings from the email log\n    - Jonah pulls the 3 clinics out of the email log into a sheet, checks them with each clinic\n        - 23:00 Jonah: 3 clinic sheet done, sends to founder, goes home\n- find and fix the records that point at nothing\n    - read the surviving tables out of prod, only reading, and load them into the restored copy\n      or a second copy of it so I can redo it if I mess up\n        - 21:45 me: manual snapshot, 2nd copy from it\n    - I list every record pointing at nothing, on the copy, decide keep or blank with founder when she lands\n        - 00:30 me + founder: put survivors + copy together, list broken records, she decides keep or blank\n- practice the switch on the copy so we dont do it for the 1st time at 7am\n    - run the switch once on the copy tonight, time it, write the steps down\n        - 01:30 me: practice switch, time it, write steps. founder reads them out\n        - 06:15 go/no go on switch\n- 7am\n    - send those 3 clinics their sat list by email no matter what, so paper is the backup\n        - 7:00 Jonah: sat lists to 3 clinics either way\n- 02:00-06:00 sleep",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
