      "index": "c1fR",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2147381496,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 669005960,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794244603138,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "oh. right, duh\nread the surviving tables out of prod, only reading, and load them into the restored copy. or a second copy of it so I can redo it if I mess up\napp is down so nothing changes while I read. thats ok right? I'm scared to even connect to prod again tbh",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "oh. right, duh\nread the surviving tables out of prod, only reading, and load them into the restored copy. or a second copy of it so I can redo it if I mess up\napp is down so nothing changes while I read. thats ok right? I'm scared to even connect to prod again tbh",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "qkfTe4alM9FQTpVcxWH3Q",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 814,
      "y": 6870,
      "width": 389.519775390625,
      "height": 575,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c1fS",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1052731657,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1189044201,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794244634745,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "grwbKind": "answer"
      },
      "text": "Not duh. That's the right fix, and the\nsecond copy is a good call. Yes, only\nreading doesn't change anything.\n\nBeing scared of that login is sensible.\nYou may not need to connect at all:\n- Check the backups page for a manual\n  snapshot. Taken now, it holds today's\n  surviving rows. Restore that to a new\n  database and read from there.\n- If you can't, make a read-only login\n  first, so a slip can't change anything.\n- Either way, no AI agent on this one.\n  Have Jonah read the database name\n  out loud before you run anything.\n\nAlso check nothing else writes while\nthe app is down, like scheduled jobs.\n\nStep 7 of 8, Task.\nUnder each measure, the actual work:\nwho, and by what time, working back\nfrom 8am. Put your sleep in as a task.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Not duh. That's the right fix, and the\nsecond copy is a good call. Yes, only\nreading doesn't change anything.\n\nBeing scared of that login is sensible.\nYou may not need to connect at all:\n- Check the backups page for a manual\n  snapshot. Taken now, it holds today's\n  surviving rows. Restore that to a new\n  database and read from there.\n- If you can't, make a read-only login\n  first, so a slip can't change anything.\n- Either way, no AI agent on this one.\n  Have Jonah read the database name\n  out loud before you run anything.\n\nAlso check nothing else writes while\nthe app is down, like scheduled jobs.\n\nStep 7 of 8, Task.\nUnder each measure, the actual work:\nwho, and by what time, working back\nfrom 8am. Put your sleep in as a task.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "spKi1JbucGj4KxVzhgEgp",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 811.2598876953125,
      "y": 7492.5,
      "width": 1157.359130859375,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c1fT",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 182721272,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 863809160,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794244655178,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "founder landed, called, not happy but ok, she's coming in. also found a 3am nightly job on reminders, turning it off NOW\n21:45 me: manual snapshot, 2nd copy from it\n23:00 Jonah: 3 clinic sheet done, sends to founder, goes home\n00:30 me + founder: put survivors + copy together, list broken records, she decides keep or blank\n01:30 me: practice switch, time it, write steps. founder reads them out\n02:00-06:00 sleep\n06:15 go/no go on switch\n7:00 Jonah: sat lists to 3 clinics either way",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "founder landed, called, not happy but ok, she's coming in. also found a 3am nightly job on reminders, turning it off NOW\n21:45 me: manual snapshot, 2nd copy from it\n23:00 Jonah: 3 clinic sheet done, sends to founder, goes home\n00:30 me + founder: put survivors + copy together, list broken records, she decides keep or blank\n01:30 me: practice switch, time it, write steps. founder reads them out\n02:00-06:00 sleep\n06:15 go/no go on switch\n7:00 Jonah: sat lists to 3 clinics either way",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
