    {
      "id": "idf-ans-ex",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1400,
      "y": 5565,
      "width": 980.639404296875,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c1fW",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 749596137,
      "version": 4,
      "versionNonce": 132297961,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794244734004,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "grwbKind": "claudeItem"
      },
      "text": "we bring back the 4 tables from the 03:08 backup, join them with todays surviving rows on a copy,\nrebuild the 3 clinics sat bookings from the email log, and switch at 6:30 only if it passes.\nif not, app stays down and clinics work off the list we email at 7\n\ngo at 06:15 = no broken records left on the copy, 3 clinics match the sheet, practice switch worked,\nwritten steps exist. any no = no go\nJonah's alarm wakes me 05:45, founder makes the call",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "we bring back the 4 tables from the 03:08 backup, join them with todays surviving rows on a copy,\nrebuild the 3 clinics sat bookings from the email log, and switch at 6:30 only if it passes.\nif not, app stays down and clinics work off the list we email at 7\n\ngo at 06:15 = no broken records left on the copy, 3 clinics match the sheet, practice switch worked,\nwritten steps exist. any no = no go\nJonah's alarm wakes me 05:45, founder makes the call",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "HUb3LRiROKLxBdquQ1M1S",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 814,
      "y": 7730,
      "width": 389.3797302246094,
      "height": 575,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c1fX",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 499457671,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1624094119,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794244696885,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "grwbKind": "answer"
      },
      "text": "That nightly job was a great catch.\nTonight at 3am it would have run.\nWrite down that it needs turning\nback on later.\n\nAnd your founder is coming in.\nYou're not alone on this any more.\n\nThis plan holds. It has names, times,\nsleep, and paper as the backup.\nIt's all in under your measures.\n\nStep 8 of 8, Answer.\nIn one or two sentences, answer your\nown Issue. Include what has to be true\nat 06:15 for a go, because you want\nthat decided before you sleep, not at\n06:15. Who makes the call?\n\nStill open, not for tonight's switch:\nthe update your note promised, the\nlast 30% of the log, the legal check,\nyour gut question and the vendor.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "That nightly job was a great catch.\nTonight at 3am it would have run.\nWrite down that it needs turning\nback on later.\n\nAnd your founder is coming in.\nYou're not alone on this any more.\n\nThis plan holds. It has names, times,\nsleep, and paper as the backup.\nIt's all in under your measures.\n\nStep 8 of 8, Answer.\nIn one or two sentences, answer your\nown Issue. Include what has to be true\nat 06:15 for a go, because you want\nthat decided before you sleep, not at\n06:15. Who makes the call?\n\nStill open, not for tonight's switch:\nthe update your note promised, the\nlast 30% of the log, the legal check,\nyour gut question and the vendor.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
