      "updated": 1794244715499,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "we bring back the 4 tables from the 03:08 backup, join them with todays surviving rows on a copy, rebuild the 3 clinics sat bookings from the email log, and switch at 6:30 only if it passes. if not, app stays down and clinics work off the list we email at 7\ngo at 06:15 = no broken records left on the copy, 3 clinics match the sheet, practice switch worked, written steps exist. any no = no go\nJonah's alarm wakes me 05:45, founder makes the call\nok. going to go do the snapshot",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "we bring back the 4 tables from the 03:08 backup, join them with todays surviving rows on a copy, rebuild the 3 clinics sat bookings from the email log, and switch at 6:30 only if it passes. if not, app stays down and clinics work off the list we email at 7\ngo at 06:15 = no broken records left on the copy, 3 clinics match the sheet, practice switch worked, written steps exist. any no = no go\nJonah's alarm wakes me 05:45, founder makes the call\nok. going to go do the snapshot",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "drLxtkbzuCaxF9xvhUiZj",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 814,
      "y": 8490,
      "width": 392.759765625,
      "height": 425,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c1fZ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1231957961,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 92753577,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794244740025,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "grwbKind": "answer"
      },
      "text": "That answers your Issue, and it's in\nas you wrote it. A clear go, a clear\nno go, and the clinics covered either\nway. You started tonight with 10 things\nat once and you wrote this yourself.\n\nGo do the snapshot. Check you're in\nthe right database first, and take\nit slowly.\n\nThe board stays here with all of it.\nWrite here any time you get stuck\ntonight. Your gut question and the\nvendor one can wait until the data\nis back, and we can take them then.\n\nGood luck, Tessa. Sleep at 02:00.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "That answers your Issue, and it's in\nas you wrote it. A clear go, a clear\nno go, and the clinics covered either\nway. You started tonight with 10 things\nat once and you wrote this yourself.\n\nGo do the snapshot. Check you're in\nthe right database first, and take\nit slowly.\n\nThe board stays here with all of it.\nWrite here any time you get stuck\ntonight. Your gut question and the\nvendor one can wait until the data\nis back, and we can take them then.\n\nGood luck, Tessa. Sleep at 02:00.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
