    {
      "id": "T5-AutTisjfvBrHUUVDAl",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4837.7200927734375,
      "y": 217.5,
      "width": 294.559814453125,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c1fx",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 882038057,
      "version": 4,
      "versionNonce": 1819505191,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794244899908,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "grwbKind": "claudeItem"
      },
      "text": "Why 2\nThe staging login had expired.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "fw-w2a",
      "originalText": "Why 2\nThe staging login had expired.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ulntFCWH7SvL74gRCXSNn",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4838.700088500977,
      "y": 305,
      "width": 292.5998229980469,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c1fyV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1672497161,
      "version": 5,
      "versionNonce": 1964570473,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794244988923,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "grwbKind": "claudeItem"
      },
      "text": "Why 2\nThe agent decided on its own\nto use a different database.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "fw-w2b",
      "originalText": "Why 2\nThe agent decided on its own\nto use a different database.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "uW632DPAYtpXDkmLqC8DZ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4805.210113525391,
      "y": 405,
      "width": 359.57977294921875,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c1fz",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2019319529,
      "version": 4,
      "versionNonce": 1504744775,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794244899908,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "grwbKind": "claudeItem"
      },
      "text": "Why 2\nThe production login was in the local\nconfig that the agent could read.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "fw-w2c",
      "originalText": "Why 2\nThe production login was in the local\nconfig that the agent could read.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Hp423Ww0JZ6VDQehepac8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3428,
      "y": 787,
      "width": 388.31976318359375,
      "height": 475,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c1g1",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 273598857,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1622061161,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794244900018,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "grwbKind": "answer"
      },
      "text": "You're right, and I said that too\nflatly. It's its own box now.\nHow it's set up, what it's told, whether\nyou keep it, and telling the vendor are\nall yours to change. The chart only has\nto go one more why past it.\n\nAll 4 are in, roles not names.\n\nOne check, the \"?\" on the 4th box:\nthe log says it tried staging first.\nSo it already knew the target. If you\nhad typed \"staging\", would it have\nstopped at the login error?\n\nThen Why 3 on your box. Why did the\nagent decide on its own to use another\ndatabase? Was anything telling it to\nstop and ask?",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "You're right, and I said that too\nflatly. It's its own box now.\nHow it's set up, what it's told, whether\nyou keep it, and telling the vendor are\nall yours to change. The chart only has\nto go one more why past it.\n\nAll 4 are in, roles not names.\n\nOne check, the \"?\" on the 4th box:\nthe log says it tried staging first.\nSo it already knew the target. If you\nhad typed \"staging\", would it have\nstopped at the login error?\n\nThen Why 3 on your box. Why did the\nagent decide on its own to use another\ndatabase? Was anything telling it to\nstop and ask?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "j56TDA3jtePeIQs5iCu9u",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3880.9928007125854,
      "y": 845,
      "width": 1575.2188720703125,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c1g3",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1252861064,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 2112072184,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794244922694,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4th box, hm. it tried staging first so it knew. typing \"staging\" wouldnt have stopped it. so I guess that one isnt a cause, take it off? I kind of wanted it to be\nwhy 3: nothing told it to stop. we have a notes file for the agent, its all code style, zero about databases or asking first\nand it didnt ask bc I clicked allow for the session. it asked like 30 times that morning and I got sick of it. so the one check we had, I turned off\nstill think a tool shouldnt quietly switch databases, thats going to the vendor",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4th box, hm. it tried staging first so it knew. typing \"staging\" wouldnt have stopped it. so I guess that one isnt a cause, take it off? I kind of wanted it to be\nwhy 3: nothing told it to stop. we have a notes file for the agent, its all code style, zero about databases or asking first\nand it didnt ask bc I clicked allow for the session. it asked like 30 times that morning and I got sick of it. so the one check we had, I turned off\nstill think a tool shouldnt quietly switch databases, thats going to the vendor",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
