      "updated": 1794244988969,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "grwbKind": "claudeItem"
      },
      "text": "Outflow",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "fw-ao1a",
      "originalText": "Outflow",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "25FiWG87m9TExs3ezEsg3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3711,
      "y": 1274,
      "width": 401.53985595703125,
      "height": 475,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c1gN",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 334120935,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 524727047,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794244989062,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "grwbKind": "answer"
      },
      "text": "Took the 4th box off. You don't have to\nown that one. The log cleared you of it.\n\nThe rest is in, and \"going to the\nvendor\" is in Notes. Good. Have the\nlawyer look before it goes.\n\nI also added a box from what you said\nbefore: it never told you it switched.\n\n\"Allow for the session\" is on the\noutflow branch. But a check that asks\n30 times a morning trains anyone to\nclick allow, so we go one more why.\n\nWhy 4 on that branch.\nWhat was it asking about those 30\ntimes? And did one click cover routine\nsteps and dangerous ones alike?",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Took the 4th box off. You don't have to\nown that one. The log cleared you of it.\n\nThe rest is in, and \"going to the\nvendor\" is in Notes. Good. Have the\nlawyer look before it goes.\n\nI also added a box from what you said\nbefore: it never told you it switched.\n\n\"Allow for the session\" is on the\noutflow branch. But a check that asks\n30 times a morning trains anyone to\nclick allow, so we go one more why.\n\nWhy 4 on that branch.\nWhat was it asking about those 30\ntimes? And did one click cover routine\nsteps and dangerous ones alike?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "WYlfxagTVSiSCdtaw-IL4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3714.2699279785156,
      "y": 1831.5,
      "width": 1815.638916015625,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c1gP",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1569657992,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 139770360,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794245013191,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "almost all boring. read this file, run the tests, read this other file. all in the same yes/no box so after a while you dont read them\nand yeah one click covers everything, files and tests and db stuff the same\nthere might be a way to set it finer than that, I dont know, I never looked. nobody has. each of us just installed it on our own laptop and started using it. no one owns how its set up",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "almost all boring. read this file, run the tests, read this other file. all in the same yes/no box so after a while you dont read them\nand yeah one click covers everything, files and tests and db stuff the same\nthere might be a way to set it finer than that, I dont know, I never looked. nobody has. each of us just installed it on our own laptop and started using it. no one owns how its set up",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
