      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "grwbKind": "claudeItem"
      },
      "text": "Why 4\nOne click covers files, tests\nand database actions the same.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "fw-o4a",
      "originalText": "Why 4\nOne click covers files, tests\nand database actions the same.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "b3AXjsA1_kafJuQcTrRt2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6672.340118408203,
      "y": 505,
      "width": 325.31976318359375,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c1gX",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1127426185,
      "version": 4,
      "versionNonce": 109065511,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794245038533,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "grwbKind": "claudeItem"
      },
      "text": "Why 5\nEach engineer installed the agent\non their own laptop.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "fw-o5a",
      "originalText": "Why 5\nEach engineer installed the agent\non their own laptop.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "C92sj3r60hfNvBCoS-bWz",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7250.000091552734,
      "y": 517.5,
      "width": 369.99981689453125,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c1gY",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 363802473,
      "version": 5,
      "versionNonce": 680112391,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794245303631,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "grwbKind": "claudeItem"
      },
      "text": "Root cause\nNo one owns how the agent is set up.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "fw-o6a",
      "originalText": "Root cause\nNo one owns how the agent is set up.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "9FrFQERA63lNCTYWlqOZ0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3544,
      "y": 1919,
      "width": 392.97979736328125,
      "height": 325,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c1gZ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 343069609,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1946973833,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794245038652,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "grwbKind": "answer"
      },
      "text": "\"No one owns how it's set up\" sounds\nlike a root cause. Your team can fix\nit, and it needs nobody's reasoning\nto change. It's on the chart with a ?\nuntil you agree.\n\nQuick yes or no: does the notes file\nbox end at that same root? It only had\ncode style because nobody owned that?\n\nNext branch.\nWhy was the production login in the\nlocal config the agent could read?",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\"No one owns how it's set up\" sounds\nlike a root cause. Your team can fix\nit, and it needs nobody's reasoning\nto change. It's on the chart with a ?\nuntil you agree.\n\nQuick yes or no: does the notes file\nbox end at that same root? It only had\ncode style because nobody owned that?\n\nNext branch.\nWhy was the production login in the\nlocal config the agent could read?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ey0dgYYfjb7C99jsviAXV",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3542.9898986816406,
      "y": 2306.5,
      "width": 3408.797607421875,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c1gb",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2029252600,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 608037256,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794245058354,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "yes notes file is the same root I think. Jonah says someone pasted it in from an old project\nprod login: bc we need it for fixing customer data by hand, like once a week. theres only one login, it can do everything, the app uses it too. no read only one, never made one. I put it in my config 2 yrs ago so I wouldnt have to look it up. and I didnt think about the agent reading that file when we started using it, I honestly didnt know it could\nthe guy who left set it up that way, but we all kept it",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "yes notes file is the same root I think. Jonah says someone pasted it in from an old project\nprod login: bc we need it for fixing customer data by hand, like once a week. theres only one login, it can do everything, the app uses it too. no read only one, never made one. I put it in my config 2 yrs ago so I wouldnt have to look it up. and I didnt think about the agent reading that file when we started using it, I honestly didnt know it could\nthe guy who left set it up that way, but we all kept it",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
