      "text": "Why 3\nThe engineer saved the production\nlogin there to avoid looking it up.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "fw-c3a",
      "originalText": "Why 3\nThe engineer saved the production\nlogin there to avoid looking it up.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "aeNYajH7VKJ9_9th1Si_W",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6055.5201416015625,
      "y": 405,
      "width": 358.959716796875,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c1gp",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1923220728,
      "version": 4,
      "versionNonce": 641268616,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794245108740,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "grwbKind": "claudeItem"
      },
      "text": "Why 4\nEngineers fix customer data by hand\nabout once a week.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "fw-c4a",
      "originalText": "Why 4\nEngineers fix customer data by hand\nabout once a week.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "h5krbLkGytPVxDe4IG5oW",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6676.420104980469,
      "y": 405,
      "width": 317.1597900390625,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c1gq",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1661380088,
      "version": 5,
      "versionNonce": 1449929511,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794245160631,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "grwbKind": "claudeItem"
      },
      "text": "Root cause\nOnly one production login exists,\nand it can do everything.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "fw-c5a",
      "originalText": "Root cause\nOnly one production login exists,\nand it can do everything.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "wK2R6aDCmTKVc-F3eyIq-",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5457.200119018555,
      "y": 205,
      "width": 355.5997619628906,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c1gr",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 3090168,
      "version": 4,
      "versionNonce": 1403013768,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794245108740,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "grwbKind": "claudeItem"
      },
      "text": "Why 3\nThe team started using the agent\nwithout checking what it could read.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "fw-c3b",
      "originalText": "Why 3\nThe team started using the agent\nwithout checking what it could read.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "6p6a3CT9jogDCkXIGRedw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6050.000091552734,
      "y": 217.5,
      "width": 369.99981689453125,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c1gs",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1184860152,
      "version": 5,
      "versionNonce": 192479175,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794245303632,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "grwbKind": "claudeItem"
      },
      "text": "Root cause\nNo one owns how the agent is set up.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "fw-c4b",
      "originalText": "Root cause\nNo one owns how the agent is set up.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "HcHB0cN7cGNurAajmAxK5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6650.000091552734,
      "y": 317.5,
      "width": 369.99981689453125,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c1gt",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 39569656,
      "version": 5,
      "versionNonce": 194730599,
      "isDeleted": false,
