    {
      "id": "fw-meas",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5500,
      "y": 980,
      "width": 1090.4593505859375,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c1hP",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2046308009,
      "version": 4,
      "versionNonce": 1147500936,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794245355020,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "grwbKind": "claudeItem"
      },
      "text": "Measures\n1. founder names one owner, one shared agent setup for all laptops, finer permissions,\n   no whole session allow, note in (stop and ask, say which database). owner: backend lead\n2. separate logins: app, read only for people + agents, write login only out of password manager\n   when 2 people are looking. no prod logins in local config. owner: backend lead\n3. shared calendar reminder 2 wks before staging login dies, reset it then. owner: support lead\n4. alert to the team when a table gets dropped. owner: backend lead (support lead maybe, ask founder monday)\n5. turn point in time on monday, and a practice restore every 3 months. owner: founder",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Measures\n1. founder names one owner, one shared agent setup for all laptops, finer permissions,\n   no whole session allow, note in (stop and ask, say which database). owner: backend lead\n2. separate logins: app, read only for people + agents, write login only out of password manager\n   when 2 people are looking. no prod logins in local config. owner: backend lead\n3. shared calendar reminder 2 wks before staging login dies, reset it then. owner: support lead\n4. alert to the team when a table gets dropped. owner: backend lead (support lead maybe, ask founder monday)\n5. turn point in time on monday, and a practice restore every 3 months. owner: founder",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "mFnpkYGECObRm4yyC0_vZ",
