      "text": "Root cause\nNo one owns the backups.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "fw-r4b",
      "originalText": "Root cause\nNo one owns the backups.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "5Mb0lK6hanSaVG2HIdr6G",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2691,
      "y": 5805,
      "width": 367.1197509765625,
      "height": 425,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c1hk",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1525705208,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1581279992,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794245355139,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "grwbKind": "answer"
      },
      "text": "All in, and founder owning this one\nis a good move.\n\nOne small change. I wrote it as its\nown root, \"No one owns the backups\".\nIt's the same pattern as root 1, but\nan owner for the agent wouldn't have\ntouched the backups.\n\nThat pattern is worth telling your\nfounder: twice it came down to\nsomething important having no owner.\n\nEvery branch now has a root and a\nmeasure. 5 roots, 5 measures.\n\nShall I draw the clean chart?",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "All in, and founder owning this one\nis a good move.\n\nOne small change. I wrote it as its\nown root, \"No one owns the backups\".\nIt's the same pattern as root 1, but\nan owner for the agent wouldn't have\ntouched the backups.\n\nThat pattern is worth telling your\nfounder: twice it came down to\nsomething important having no owner.\n\nEvery branch now has a root and a\nmeasure. 5 roots, 5 measures.\n\nShall I draw the clean chart?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "u9y2JK3VwZQhyAAwY-uAM",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2689.5598754882812,
      "y": 6290,
      "width": 1215.178955078125,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c1hmV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1351389064,
      "version": 5,
      "versionNonce": 441407657,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794245505512,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "yes draw it. I want to show founder monday\njust keep the box where the agent switched databases and didnt say. I dont want that disappearing just bc we cant fix it",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "yes draw it. I want to show founder monday\njust keep the box where the agent switched databases and didnt say. I dont want that disappearing just bc we cant fix it",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
