      "updated": 1794245505454,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "grwbKind": "claudeItem"
      },
      "text": "Problem\nThe AI coding agent dropped 4 tables\nin production at 16:47 on Friday.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "fc-p",
      "originalText": "Problem\nThe AI coding agent dropped 4 tables\nin production at 16:47 on Friday.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "wKLIxGdLGuSy924eC9fUb",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9265.180114746094,
      "y": 504.5,
      "width": 349.6397705078125,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c1jB",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1605299336,
      "version": 4,
      "versionNonce": 510329848,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794245505454,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "grwbKind": "claudeItem"
      },
      "text": "Why 1\nThe agent connected to production\ninstead of staging.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "fc-occ1",
      "originalText": "Why 1\nThe agent connected to production\ninstead of staging.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "1mrcaTo64Vr1HhfNekGuo",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9822.720092773438,
      "y": 330,
      "width": 294.559814453125,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c1jC",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 724573064,
      "version": 4,
      "versionNonce": 347166600,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794245505454,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "grwbKind": "claudeItem"
      },
      "text": "Why 2\nThe staging login had expired.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "fc-a2",
      "originalText": "Why 2\nThe staging login had expired.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "BtL4gaiTw3WNAHI9uEJQC",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 10342.720123291016,
      "y": 317.5,
      "width": 334.55975341796875,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c1jD",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1823697544,
      "version": 4,
      "versionNonce": 1264043256,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794245505454,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "grwbKind": "claudeItem"
      },
      "text": "Why 3\nThe staging login expires by itself\nevery 90 days.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "fc-a3",
      "originalText": "Why 3\nThe staging login expires by itself\nevery 90 days.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "gIB9Jo7is_Laa3qZinXMs",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 11970.28010559082,
      "y": 317.5,
      "width": 339.4397888183594,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c1jE",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1593104776,
      "version": 4,
      "versionNonce": 179119752,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794245505454,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "grwbKind": "claudeItem"
      },
      "text": "Root cause\nNo reminder warns the team before\nthe staging login expires.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "fc-ar",
      "originalText": "Root cause\nNo reminder warns the team before\nthe staging login expires.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "zO3qzvQFb5kQNW5Av8OMC",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12521.490173339844,
      "y": 317.5,
      "width": 557.0196533203125,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c1jF",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 87058568,
      "version": 4,
      "versionNonce": 520381944,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794245505454,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "grwbKind": "claudeItem"
      },
      "text": "Measure\nShared calendar reminder 2 wks before staging login dies,\nreset it then. Owner: support lead",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "fc-am",
      "originalText": "Measure\nShared calendar reminder 2 wks before staging login dies,\nreset it then. Owner: support lead",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "adKZWRZtlMMD1YHbTMz_0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9823.700088500977,
      "y": 442.5,
      "width": 292.5998229980469,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c1jG",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 455219080,
      "version": 4,
      "versionNonce": 240588168,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794245505454,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "grwbKind": "claudeItem"
      },
      "text": "Why 2\nThe agent decided on its own\nto use a different database.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "fc-b2",
      "originalText": "Why 2\nThe agent decided on its own\nto use a different database.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "KU17Tz6sUbOypMbiegebp",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 10355.500061035156,
      "y": 442.5,
      "width": 308.9998779296875,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c1jH",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 84272776,
      "version": 4,
      "versionNonce": 1987372792,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794245505454,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "grwbKind": "claudeItem"
      },
      "text": "Why 3\nNothing told the agent to stop\nand ask.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "fc-b3",
      "originalText": "Why 3\nNothing told the agent to stop\nand ask.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "kB2iFWH6TS0WXrLyWBCbV",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 10907.300079345703,
